WEBVTT

00:00:53.390 --> 00:00:56.360
<i>It was the start of another 
blazing hot summer.</i>

00:01:01.490 --> 00:01:03.910
<b>Summer Tournament
Sendai</b>

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:08.550
<i>That moment we all yearn
 for when we're young...</i>

00:01:08.550 --> 00:01:12.150
<i>Giving everything you have and
pushing yourself to the limit</i>

00:01:12.150 --> 00:01:13.840
<i>for one brief flash of glory.</i>

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:16.300
<i>This was one such blazing hot summer.</i>

00:01:27.730 --> 00:01:28.820
<i>It's over...</i>

00:01:29.370 --> 00:01:31.350
We're heading out, Futaba.

00:01:48.740 --> 00:01:51.790
<i>Three straight years on the bench.</i>

00:02:03.220 --> 00:02:05.220
<i>I-Is that some kind of ritual?</i>

00:02:05.680 --> 00:02:06.740
Guys.

00:02:08.130 --> 00:02:09.990
It's time.

00:02:09.990 --> 00:02:11.560
Have fun out there, like always.

00:02:11.560 --> 00:02:12.630
You said it!

00:02:12.630 --> 00:02:14.160
Let's do this, guys!

00:02:14.160 --> 00:02:14.860
Yah!

00:02:14.860 --> 00:02:16.940
Let's get it done!

00:02:16.940 --> 00:02:18.780
Watari, watch your finishing pose.

00:02:18.780 --> 00:02:19.450
Yah.

00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:21.000
And your handstand posture, Onagawa.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:22.580
No worries there.

00:02:22.580 --> 00:02:23.510
Time to show our stuff.

00:02:23.510 --> 00:02:26.140
Don't just show it. Keep it aligned.

00:02:26.140 --> 00:02:27.080
Right.

00:02:31.140 --> 00:02:32.330
Music?

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:12.830
<b>70th Miyagi Prefecture Inter-High Athletics Tournament
Men's Rhythmic Gymnastics</b>

00:03:09.680 --> 00:03:12.830
"Miyagi Prefecture Inter-High
 Athletics Tournament."

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:14.620
"Men's rhythmic gymnastics"?

00:03:15.030 --> 00:03:17.570
Boys do rhythmic gymnastics, too?

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:39.690
They're the boys I saw before...

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:41.900
<i>Competing ninth:
 Soshukan Private High School.</i>

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:52.450
Ready!

00:07:19.060 --> 00:07:20.410
Incredible.

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:24.500
Incredible... Just incredible!

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:28.880
<b>70th Miyagi Prefecture Inter-High Athletics Tournament 

00:07:26.010 --> 00:07:28.420
Soshukan High School...

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:29.300
<b>70th Miyagi Prefecture Inter-High Athletics Tournament
Men's Rhythmic Gymnastics</b>

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:29.300
<b>Soshukan High School</b>

00:07:29.300 --> 00:07:31.550
<b>70th Miyagi Prefecture Inter-High Athletics Tournament
Men's Rhythmic Gymnastics</b>

00:07:29.300 --> 00:07:31.550
<b>Soshukan High School</b>

00:07:29.300 --> 00:07:31.550
<b>Score</b>

00:07:31.550 --> 00:07:32.180
<b>70th Miyagi Prefecture Inter-High Athletics Tournament
Men's Rhythmic Gymnastics</b>

00:07:32.180 --> 00:07:33.990
<i><b>Sendai Tokuou

00:07:33.990 --> 00:07:34.850
<i><b>Sendai Tokuou

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:40.980
Why is their score so low?

00:07:41.490 --> 00:07:43.750
Actually, that's high.

00:07:43.750 --> 00:07:45.900
To score fifteen with only four members...

00:07:46.370 --> 00:07:49.360
Ao High, huh? Not bad at all.

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:51.790
B-But they lost, didn't they?

00:07:51.790 --> 00:07:53.920
First time watching men's rhythmic gymnastics?

00:07:53.920 --> 00:07:55.030
Y-Yes...

00:07:55.030 --> 00:07:59.530
Men's rhythmic gymnastics groups 
are supposed to have six people.

00:07:59.530 --> 00:08:01.660
You can compete with as few as four,

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:04.980
but you're docked a point and a half 
for each missing member.

00:08:04.980 --> 00:08:06.820
Is that a lot?

00:08:06.820 --> 00:08:08.840
Well, a perfect score would be twenty.

00:08:09.350 --> 00:08:12.960
Men's rhythmic gymnastics 
routines are graded by deductions.

00:08:12.960 --> 00:08:15.980
You start with max points 
and lose some for each mistake.

00:08:15.980 --> 00:08:18.470
So for them to still score over fifteen...

00:08:18.470 --> 00:08:21.270
<i><b>Kurihara City Third

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:20.880
That <i>is</i> incredible!

00:08:22.110 --> 00:08:25.310
We're up against Sendai Tokuou
 for regionals, then.

00:08:25.310 --> 00:08:27.540
Sounds boring.

00:08:27.540 --> 00:08:29.820
You're more interested in Ao High, I'll bet.

00:08:30.990 --> 00:08:32.070
Let's go.

00:08:32.820 --> 00:08:36.450
<i>We will now be holding the awards ceremony.</i>

00:08:36.750 --> 00:08:42.280
<i>All competitors, please return to the 
arena in accordance with instructions.</i>

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:40.500
Let's go, Misa-pon.

00:10:10.460 --> 00:10:14.960
<b><i>Backflip!!</i></b>

00:10:15.330 --> 00:10:17.090
Men's rhythmic gymnastics?

00:10:17.090 --> 00:10:19.440
Huh, I didn't know that was a thing.

00:10:19.440 --> 00:10:21.050
Yeah, it was really something.

00:10:21.050 --> 00:10:24.830
I never knew the human body 
could move like that!

00:10:24.830 --> 00:10:26.100
Oh, yeah?

00:10:26.100 --> 00:10:27.910
Speaking of, I heard somewhere

00:10:27.910 --> 00:10:31.730
that it's especially popular 
here in the Tohoku region.

00:10:32.890 --> 00:10:37.940
I still thought the Ao High 
guys were the best...

00:10:38.830 --> 00:10:40.200
Let's eat!

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:42.870
Did you make Shotaro's 
gyoza bigger than ours?

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:45.280
Sho-chan's worn out from his game today.

00:10:45.280 --> 00:10:46.920
From warming the bench, you mean?

00:10:48.430 --> 00:10:50.390
I'm sorry it ended the way it did,

00:10:50.390 --> 00:10:52.440
but I'm glad your time 
on the team was drama-free.

00:10:52.440 --> 00:10:53.810
Now you can focus on entrance exams.

00:10:53.810 --> 00:10:56.010
Do you know where you're applying yet?

00:10:56.010 --> 00:10:59.930
Well, as far as my grades are concerned...

00:10:59.930 --> 00:11:01.590
Is there anywhere you <i>want</i> to go?

00:11:01.590 --> 00:11:02.890
Anywhere I want to go?

00:11:02.890 --> 00:11:05.870
Yeah. Where do you want to go?

00:11:05.870 --> 00:11:07.590
It's important to do what you want.

00:11:07.590 --> 00:11:09.910
And what if that's <i>not</i> going to school?

00:11:09.910 --> 00:11:12.150
He's saying to give it some thought.

00:11:13.010 --> 00:11:14.770
What I want to do...

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:18.990
<b>Daitokai</b>

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:18.990
<b>Kojien
</b>Fifth Ed.

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:18.990
<b>Iwanami Dictionary</b>

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:18.990
<b>Shin  Meikai  Dictionary</b>

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:18.990
<b>Daijirin
</b>Third Ed.

00:11:18.990 --> 00:11:20.820
Kairin High School

00:11:18.990 --> 00:11:20.820
Be healthy
and study hard

00:11:18.990 --> 00:11:20.820
<b>Soshukan
High School</b>

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:30.830
What I want to do... Where I want to go...

00:11:48.420 --> 00:11:51.180
Wait... What?

00:11:51.180 --> 00:11:56.090
Sho-chan! Better get going, 
or you'll miss the entrance ceremony!

00:11:54.600 --> 00:11:56.090
I'm off!

00:11:56.090 --> 00:11:58.080
Hey! Don't run with food in your mouth!

00:12:02.490 --> 00:12:06.370
Soshukan Private High School
Entrance Ceremony

00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:14.660
The world around us is unpredictable,

00:12:14.660 --> 00:12:16.100
but one thing that is certain

00:12:16.100 --> 00:12:19.380
is the fact that you must forge 
your own path to the future.

00:12:19.730 --> 00:12:22.920
<b><i>Recruit new members</i></b>

00:12:19.730 --> 00:12:22.920
<b>TWO OF THEM</b>

00:12:19.730 --> 00:12:22.920
<b>Go get 'em<i>!!</i></b>

00:12:19.730 --> 00:12:22.920
<b><i>Goal</i></b>

00:12:20.070 --> 00:12:22.920
Okay, our goal is to bag 
at least two new members!

00:12:22.920 --> 00:12:23.920
Yah!

00:12:23.920 --> 00:12:26.090
Are you sure about this, Shichigahama?

00:12:26.090 --> 00:12:30.840
If we wait until classes start, the other 
clubs'll snatch up the best recruits!

00:12:30.840 --> 00:12:32.460
Of course they will.

00:12:32.460 --> 00:12:38.060
Most student athletes are here 
for the baseball and soccer clubs.

00:12:38.060 --> 00:12:41.710
Basketball an' volleyball are
 gettin' good these days, too.

00:12:41.710 --> 00:12:42.940
I know, right?

00:12:42.940 --> 00:12:44.500
Enough with the bad attitudes!

00:12:44.500 --> 00:12:46.210
We gotta make it to the Inter-High

00:12:46.210 --> 00:12:50.990
and prove that Ao High's a place 
for men's rhythmic gymnastics!

00:12:50.990 --> 00:12:54.110
And to do that, we need six members!

00:12:54.110 --> 00:12:54.830
Yah!

00:12:54.830 --> 00:12:56.670
I know, but still...

00:12:58.380 --> 00:12:59.340
<b>Come backflip with us!
The men's rhythmic gymnastics club
is now recruiting!!

00:12:58.380 --> 00:12:59.340
Here.

00:12:59.340 --> 00:13:01.720
Huh? What's the meaning of this, manager?

00:13:01.720 --> 00:13:03.640
Each of you has to give out one hundred.

00:13:03.640 --> 00:13:04.930
Get it done.

00:13:04.930 --> 00:13:07.540
Anyone here seein' that I got extra?

00:13:08.930 --> 00:13:10.610
Hey, here they come!

00:13:10.610 --> 00:13:11.770
Let's go!

00:13:11.770 --> 00:13:15.140
Hey, you! You look like you're in shape!

00:13:15.140 --> 00:13:17.610
Well, that's our captain.

00:13:15.140 --> 00:13:20.030
Well? Wanna try men's rhythmic gymnastics?

00:13:17.610 --> 00:13:21.150
Unstoppable once he's 
made up his mind. Like always.

00:13:20.030 --> 00:13:23.290
You, too!

00:13:21.150 --> 00:13:23.290
Now, let's get out there!

00:13:23.290 --> 00:13:24.110
Yah!

00:13:24.110 --> 00:13:25.340
What's that all about?

00:13:25.340 --> 00:13:26.820
Did he say men's rhythmic gymnastics?

00:13:26.820 --> 00:13:28.920
They're really champing at the bit, huh?

00:13:28.920 --> 00:13:30.600
What club are you gonna join?

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:35.650
Wanna try men's rhythmic gymnastics?

00:13:35.650 --> 00:13:38.490
Doesn't get much cooler 
than continuous backflips!

00:13:38.490 --> 00:13:39.600
Well? Wanna join us?

00:13:39.600 --> 00:13:41.900
Onagawa! You're supposed to recruit <i>guys</i>!

00:13:41.900 --> 00:13:43.210
Ya sonsa bitches!

00:13:43.210 --> 00:13:46.120
Too good to accept a flyer 
from yer senpai, are ya?

00:13:46.120 --> 00:13:47.020
Huh?!

00:13:47.020 --> 00:13:48.220
Stop that.

00:13:57.690 --> 00:14:01.230
<i>Wh-Wh-What do I do? I'm n-n-not ready...</i>

00:14:01.230 --> 00:14:02.900
I'd like to join.

00:14:05.350 --> 00:14:07.030
Wh-What'd you say?

00:14:07.030 --> 00:14:10.370
I'd like to join the men's 
rhythmic gymnastics club.

00:14:19.620 --> 00:14:21.630
Got one!

00:14:21.630 --> 00:14:22.870
Glad to have you!

00:14:22.870 --> 00:14:23.720
You mean it?

00:14:23.720 --> 00:14:24.740
Welcome!

00:14:24.740 --> 00:14:25.960
Good to meetcha!

00:14:27.310 --> 00:14:29.930
<i>Now it's even more awkward...</i>

00:14:33.470 --> 00:14:37.350
<b>Men's
Rhythmic
Gymnastics
Club</b>

00:14:37.350 --> 00:14:40.650
<b>Men's Rhythmic
Gymnastics Club</b>

00:14:40.650 --> 00:14:42.940
Club Application

00:14:40.650 --> 00:14:42.940
April 7th, 2022

00:14:40.650 --> 00:14:42.940
Class 1-B, Student no. 33\h\h\h Ryoya Misato

00:14:40.650 --> 00:14:42.940
Ryoya Misato?

00:14:43.450 --> 00:14:45.130
What's up, Kurikoma?

00:14:47.150 --> 00:14:53.030
[Men's Rhythmic Gymnastics]

00:14:47.770 --> 00:14:51.360
He finished second in the the 37th National 
Junior Men's Rhythmic Gymnastics Tournament

00:14:51.360 --> 00:14:53.030
in individuals.

00:14:53.030 --> 00:14:54.780
<i>That</i> Ryoya Misato.

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:59.920
<b>Men's
Rhythmic
Gymnastics
Club</b>

00:14:59.920 --> 00:15:02.360
I thought you looked familiar.

00:14:59.920 --> 00:15:07.380
<b><i>Recruit new members</i></b>

00:14:59.920 --> 00:15:07.380
<b>TWO OF THEM</b>

00:14:59.920 --> 00:15:07.380
<b>Go get 'em<i>!!</i></b>

00:14:59.920 --> 00:15:07.380
<b><i>Goal</i></b>

00:15:02.360 --> 00:15:05.340
Misato? Natori Fourth Junior High's ace?

00:15:05.340 --> 00:15:07.380
So what brings you to our school?

00:15:07.380 --> 00:15:08.850
Yeah, really.

00:15:08.850 --> 00:15:10.340
Why not pick a halfway decent—

00:15:10.340 --> 00:15:12.100
Onagawa.

00:15:12.100 --> 00:15:15.430
You talkin' about Ao High 
like it's <i>not</i> decent?

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:17.380
I'm sorry, Captain!

00:15:17.380 --> 00:15:19.730
Lay off the looming a little!

00:15:17.850 --> 00:15:19.730
You have some skill.

00:15:19.730 --> 00:15:22.470
Although, Senpai, while your handstand

00:15:23.120 --> 00:15:26.610
looked perfectly proper 
at last year's prefecturals,

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:28.450
you dropped your elbows.

00:15:28.450 --> 00:15:30.280
A 0.05 point deduction.

00:15:31.330 --> 00:15:33.620
Watch yer mouth with yer senpai, punk!

00:15:33.620 --> 00:15:37.540
You were unsteady in two movements 
and threw the team off balance.

00:15:37.540 --> 00:15:39.570
I'm so sorry!

00:15:39.570 --> 00:15:42.080
It's fine, Watari. We're all good now.

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:44.570
It seems you have a good eye.

00:15:44.570 --> 00:15:46.750
But we only do group competitions.

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:48.420
That's perfect.

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:50.800
Great! That makes five!

00:15:50.800 --> 00:15:53.190
One more and we're Inter-High bound!

00:15:53.190 --> 00:15:53.920
Nice!

00:15:53.920 --> 00:15:57.320
<i>I can't follow up an all-star recruit...</i>

00:15:57.320 --> 00:15:58.430
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:15:58.430 --> 00:15:59.990
I'll let Shusaku know.

00:15:59.990 --> 00:16:01.260
Sounds good.

00:16:00.730 --> 00:16:05.020
<b>Men's
Rhythmic
Gymnastics
Club</b>

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:11.200
Um...

00:16:12.130 --> 00:16:13.520
Intruder detected.

00:16:13.520 --> 00:16:14.820
What? No—

00:16:14.820 --> 00:16:23.250
<b>Men's
Rhythmic
Gymnastics
Club</b>

00:16:15.180 --> 00:16:16.960
What do we have here, Kurikoma?

00:16:16.960 --> 00:16:18.200
Um, I...

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:19.260
You here to raid us?!

00:16:19.260 --> 00:16:21.880
I d-don't want any trouble...

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:25.970
I... I just... er...

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:33.430
<b>Men's
Rhythmic
Gymnastics
Club</b>

00:16:25.970 --> 00:16:27.040
I know you.

00:16:27.040 --> 00:16:28.240
Is he a friend of yours?

00:16:28.240 --> 00:16:30.780
We watched last year's 
prefectural tournament together.

00:16:30.780 --> 00:16:33.430
So we have another hopeful, do we?

00:16:33.430 --> 00:16:35.740
Huh? Er, I...

00:16:35.740 --> 00:16:38.430
Fine by me. You can watch our first session.

00:16:38.430 --> 00:16:40.690
R-Right...

00:16:43.560 --> 00:16:46.980
Let's start with introductions.

00:16:46.980 --> 00:16:50.160
Third-year. Captain Masamune Shichigahama.

00:16:50.920 --> 00:16:54.800
Vice Captain Keisuke Tsukidate. 
Also a third-year. It's a pleasure!

00:16:55.610 --> 00:16:58.750
Third-year Nagayoshi Onagawa.
 Nice to meet you.

00:16:58.750 --> 00:17:00.580
Second-year Kotaro Watari!

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:02.130
I'm Ryoya Misato.

00:17:02.130 --> 00:17:03.710
I am Shotaro Futaba!

00:17:03.710 --> 00:17:06.660
I know you just joined us, Misato, 
but we expect you to keep up.

00:17:06.660 --> 00:17:07.460
Understood.

00:17:07.460 --> 00:17:11.260
Don't worry. You're just here 
to get a feel for things.

00:17:11.260 --> 00:17:12.090
Okay.

00:17:12.090 --> 00:17:13.160
Hey there.

00:17:13.160 --> 00:17:13.800
Heya.

00:17:13.800 --> 00:17:14.490
Hi!

00:17:14.490 --> 00:17:15.020
Hey.

00:17:15.020 --> 00:17:15.810
Hello.

00:17:15.810 --> 00:17:17.490
H-Hello...

00:17:17.490 --> 00:17:19.680
So Misato-kun's our new recruit,

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:21.510
and Futaba-kun's just watching for today?

00:17:21.510 --> 00:17:25.100
I'm Shusaku Shida, the men's 
rhythmic gymnastics club coach.

00:17:25.100 --> 00:17:28.440
I'm the manager. Second-year Asao Kurikoma.

00:17:28.440 --> 00:17:30.690
A pleasure to meet you both.

00:17:30.690 --> 00:17:36.570
One, two! One, two! One, two! One, two!

00:17:43.200 --> 00:17:46.490
These are interesting warm-up exercises...

00:17:46.490 --> 00:17:48.440
They're isolation stretches.

00:17:49.010 --> 00:17:50.560
You're pretty flexible, you know?

00:17:50.560 --> 00:17:51.820
Am I?

00:17:51.820 --> 00:17:54.140
Yeah. You're a natural 
for rhythmic gymnastics.

00:17:56.730 --> 00:17:57.940
Any previous sports experience?

00:17:57.940 --> 00:18:00.670
A little swimming, soccer, and baseball.

00:18:00.670 --> 00:18:02.470
That's perfect.

00:18:02.820 --> 00:18:04.680
The full-body conditioning from swimming,

00:18:04.680 --> 00:18:06.490
the balance from soccer,

00:18:06.490 --> 00:18:08.750
and the muscle training 
and agility from baseball

00:18:08.750 --> 00:18:11.050
will all come in handy 
in rhythmic gymnastics.

00:18:11.050 --> 00:18:12.480
Really?

00:18:13.130 --> 00:18:15.200
Okay, Misato, let's move on to tumbling.

00:18:15.200 --> 00:18:15.990
Sure.

00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:18.150
What's tumbling?

00:18:18.150 --> 00:18:22.020
A series of leaps and rolls 
across the floor or mat.

00:18:26.840 --> 00:18:29.170
That's an ace for you.

00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:32.070
Misato-kun.

00:18:32.070 --> 00:18:34.720
I want a round-off into 
a salto backwards layout,

00:18:34.720 --> 00:18:38.300
a half twist, and a forward salto.

00:18:38.720 --> 00:18:39.530
Understood.

00:19:02.190 --> 00:19:03.660
Incredible...

00:19:03.660 --> 00:19:06.550
Futaba-kun, want to 
try some arabesques?

00:19:06.550 --> 00:19:08.200
S-Sure.

00:19:08.200 --> 00:19:09.990
He's got good posture.

00:19:09.990 --> 00:19:12.140
I like what I'm seeing.

00:19:12.140 --> 00:19:14.260
Misato-kun is good too, but...

00:19:17.760 --> 00:19:19.480
Good abdominal strength.

00:19:19.480 --> 00:19:21.920
He might be cut out for this.

00:19:21.920 --> 00:19:23.820
"A knack is nice,"

00:19:23.820 --> 00:19:25.360
"but enjoyment is everything."

00:19:25.360 --> 00:19:27.090
My wife says that all the time!

00:19:27.090 --> 00:19:30.040
Y-Your... wife, huh?

00:19:31.480 --> 00:19:32.640
So, what do you think?

00:19:32.640 --> 00:19:35.550
O-Oh, well...

00:19:35.550 --> 00:19:37.940
I still don't really know.

00:19:37.940 --> 00:19:40.280
You've been interested
 in the sport for a while, right?

00:19:40.800 --> 00:19:44.310
The first time I saw it was your 
tournament performance last year.

00:19:44.310 --> 00:19:46.460
Too bad we lost that one.

00:19:46.460 --> 00:19:48.620
B-But you were awesome!

00:19:48.620 --> 00:19:51.680
You soared so high and moved so fast!

00:19:51.680 --> 00:19:53.370
I could hardly believe my eyes!

00:19:53.370 --> 00:19:57.960
And watching you backflip, 
then backflip all together...

00:19:57.960 --> 00:19:59.870
It was just the coolest.

00:19:59.870 --> 00:20:02.450
It really made me wish I could do it, too.

00:20:04.640 --> 00:20:06.400
Then let's try a backflip!

00:20:06.400 --> 00:20:08.370
What? Isn't it a little soon?

00:20:08.370 --> 00:20:10.640
Don't sweat it! Just come with me.

00:20:11.940 --> 00:20:12.840
Ready?

00:20:12.840 --> 00:20:14.810
Throw yourself up like <i>vwoosh</i>!

00:20:14.810 --> 00:20:17.230
Then it's <i>oomph</i> with your hips, 
and your legs go <i>bam</i>!

00:20:17.230 --> 00:20:19.280
Then at the end, your arms go <i>bwash</i>!

00:20:19.280 --> 00:20:20.280
<i>Huh?</i>

00:20:20.280 --> 00:20:22.180
I don't think that's helping.

00:20:22.180 --> 00:20:23.370
You don't?

00:20:23.370 --> 00:20:24.620
Anyway, let's give it a try.

00:20:24.620 --> 00:20:26.000
O-Okay.

00:20:29.110 --> 00:20:30.180
Hey, now...

00:20:30.180 --> 00:20:31.750
Try more <i>pow</i> with you chest.

00:20:31.750 --> 00:20:33.920
My chest?

00:20:33.920 --> 00:20:35.030
Help me out, Tsukidate.

00:20:35.030 --> 00:20:36.330
Yeah, sure.

00:20:36.710 --> 00:20:39.480
We'll hold you up, 
so jump as high as you can.

00:20:39.480 --> 00:20:40.360
Right!

00:20:42.650 --> 00:20:43.860
You okay?

00:20:44.840 --> 00:20:47.100
I guess I can't really do it yet.

00:20:58.160 --> 00:20:59.920
<i>He's sticking his chest out proud...</i>

00:21:05.800 --> 00:21:07.400
What Misato-kun just did...

00:21:07.400 --> 00:21:10.050
Is that what you meant 
by going <i>pow</i> with your chest?

00:21:10.500 --> 00:21:12.200
Wanna call it a day?

00:21:12.200 --> 00:21:14.160
No! Let's keep going!

00:21:18.510 --> 00:21:20.170
Okay! One more time!

00:21:20.170 --> 00:21:21.270
Right!

00:21:21.270 --> 00:21:23.370
Commit to it. Don't be afraid.

00:21:23.370 --> 00:21:24.130
Right!

00:21:24.130 --> 00:21:25.680
Focus on your chest.

00:21:25.680 --> 00:21:26.520
Right!

00:21:29.230 --> 00:21:30.970
Okay, looking good.

00:21:30.970 --> 00:21:32.860
I think you have the form down.

00:21:33.280 --> 00:21:35.160
Wanna try it once without help?

00:21:35.160 --> 00:21:36.020
Yes!

00:21:38.090 --> 00:21:40.570
<i>I've never felt this way before.</i>

00:21:41.410 --> 00:21:44.790
<i>I've always gone where people 
invited me, just going with the flow...</i>

00:21:45.320 --> 00:21:49.180
<i>But I've never pursued an interest so avidly.</i>

00:21:49.870 --> 00:21:53.840
<i>Even if I lost, even if I never
 became a regular, I didn't mind.</i>

00:21:54.610 --> 00:21:57.250
<i>But now... I want to soar.</i>

00:21:57.250 --> 00:21:59.380
<i>I'm dying to learn how!</i>

00:22:00.310 --> 00:22:02.340
<i>Is it because I chose this?</i>

00:22:02.340 --> 00:22:05.800
<i>Because it's the first time 
I've decided what I want to do?</i>

00:22:06.860 --> 00:22:09.900
<i>Where I want to go... What I want to do...</i>

00:22:09.900 --> 00:22:12.100
<i>I really, truly...</i>

00:22:17.430 --> 00:22:18.810
<i>I want to backflip!</i>

00:22:21.880 --> 00:22:24.560
<i>My body's rising into the air.</i>

00:22:24.560 --> 00:22:27.760
<i>I've never felt so light before.</i>

00:22:27.760 --> 00:22:30.370
<i>And as everything spins around me...</i>

00:22:34.180 --> 00:22:36.760
<i>It's like the world is opening up before me!</i>

00:22:40.830 --> 00:22:42.500
Heck yeah!

00:22:42.880 --> 00:22:43.880
Cool.

00:22:43.880 --> 00:22:45.300
Not half bad.

00:22:49.080 --> 00:22:50.510
I'm joining...

00:22:51.270 --> 00:22:54.040
I'm joining the rhythmic gymnastics club!
